  "ruleText": "We 101.01 “Abandoned well” means a well which is inactive and is not maintained by the owner.\n\nSource. #2557, eff 12-27-83; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6448, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7306, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9177, eff 6-13-08",
